  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, whisk together lemongrass, kecap manis, coriander powder, cumin powder, and salt.",
    "2. Add the chicken pieces to the marinade and mix well.",
    "3. Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 2 hours or overnight.",
    "4. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "5. Thread the marinated chicken onto skewers.",
    "6. Brush the skewers with quietly oil.",
    "7. Grill the satay for 5-7 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "8. Serve with Malaysian peanut sauce for dipping."
